    <h1 class="X"> My Father – My Real-Life Superhero

Srinivas is my father, and he is my real-life superhero. His full name is Venkata Srinivas, but he is lovingly called Srinu or Srinivas. He is 50 years old. He is an independent, hardworking, and responsible person.

From his childhood until today, he has always worked hard. Even though his two elder daughters are working in software companies, my father continues to work hard to save money for his family's future, health, and careers. He hardly takes any rest, even when he is not feeling well. For him, there are no holidays when it comes to fulfilling his family responsibilities.

My father has three daughters. His first daughter, Rupa Sree, is working in a software company and has five years of experience. His second daughter is also working in a software company and has one year of experience. I am the youngest daughter and the third child in our family. I am currently studying at NRI University. My nickname is Ammulu, and my name is Kowmya Sri.

My mother's name is Ramalakshmi. She is a well-educated, understanding, and hardworking woman. She is also very adjustable and supportive. My father loves all three of his daughters and treats us equally, although sometimes he shows special affection towards his second daughter.

Sometimes, I feel that I am not doing anything to make my parents proud because I am still studying. However, I hope to achieve something great in the future and make my parents happy.

During the middle of his life journey, my father faced many difficulties. He lost his business, money, and reputation. He also faced many challenges and criticism from relatives. Despite all these struggles, he never gave up. After several years of hard work, he built his own house and slowly started rebuilding his family's life.

After a few years, he worked hard to settle his daughters' lives. First, he helped his eldest daughter establish her career. After four years, he helped his second daughter move forward in her career. Now, he is continuing to work hard for my future and my career.

My father is a self-respecting person. He never wants his family to suffer because of him. Sometimes, he gets angry when things do not go as expected, but he always tries to control his emotions. Whenever he is around people, he tries to make them happy and cares deeply about them.

One of the most special things about my father is his love for his mother. He loves his mother more than anything in this world. Her name is Suryakantamma. He has two elder brothers and one elder sister. I think he is especially close to his eldest brother.

**Finally, my father is not just a person who earns money for our family. He is the person who sacrifices his happiness, comfort, and dreams for our future. His struggles, hard work, love, and dedication inspire me every day. I may not be able to give him everything today, but one day I want to make him proud.**

**My father is my strength, my inspiration, and my forever superhero. ❤️**</p></h1>
